    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with four friends and dive into mysterious mines in search of hidden treasure. But be careful - the deeper you go, the more evil awakens to stop you. Encounter strangers between descents, help them and earn valuable rewards. Find treasure, complete quests, and fight your way through the darkness as you struggle to reach the surface before it\u2019s too late. But remember... the shadows are watching you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Experience</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237420/extras/7715f4a93f157d1536747fc1c40840dc.poster.avif?t=1752174382\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237420/extras/7715f4a93f157d1536747fc1c40840dc.webm?t=1752174382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237420/extras/7715f4a93f157d1536747fc1c40840dc.mp4?t=1752174382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You head to explore within the maze-like, procedurally generated tunnels. Each descent offers a fresh, spine-chilling adventure with new layouts, obstacles, and secrets to uncover. The deeper you go, the greater the dangers you face, from puzzles to terrifying creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Multiplayer </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 4 players in this intense, cooperative experience. Communication and teamwork are vital as you work together to complete your tasks, survive, and decide whether to finish the mission or reset the game and try again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terrifying Creatures and Challenges</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against terrifying creatures, each with unique behaviors, forcing you to adapt and find new survival strategies. From puzzles blocking your path to creatures hunting you in the dark, every descent offers unpredictable dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with four friends and dive into mysterious mines in search of hidden treasure. But be careful - the deeper you go, the more evil awakens to stop you. Encounter strangers between descents, help them and earn valuable rewards. Find treasure, complete quests, and fight your way through the darkness as you struggle to reach the surface before it\u2019s too late. But remember... the shadows are watching you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Experience</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237420/extras/7715f4a93f157d1536747fc1c40840dc.poster.avif?t=1752174382\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237420/extras/7715f4a93f157d1536747fc1c40840dc.webm?t=1752174382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237420/extras/7715f4a93f157d1536747fc1c40840dc.mp4?t=1752174382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You head to explore within the maze-like, procedurally generated tunnels. Each descent offers a fresh, spine-chilling adventure with new layouts, obstacles, and secrets to uncover. The deeper you go, the greater the dangers you face, from puzzles to terrifying creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Multiplayer </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 4 players in this intense, cooperative experience. Communication and teamwork are vital as you work together to complete your tasks, survive, and decide whether to finish the mission or reset the game and try again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terrifying Creatures and Challenges</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against terrifying creatures, each with unique behaviors, forcing you to adapt and find new survival strategies. From puzzles blocking your path to creatures hunting you in the dark, every descent offers unpredictable dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
